tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RDI&#x0003c;85&#x00025;, <italic>n</italic> (&#x00025;)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4 (7)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4 (7)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">6 (5)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t2-fn1"><label/><p>D=docetaxel 100&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup> every 21 days; FEC100=fluorouracil 500&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>, epirubicin 100&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>, cyclophosphamide 500&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup> every 21 days; RDI=relative dose intensity; T=trastuzumab.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Haematologic toxicities of treatment</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>4 FEC100</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>6 FEC100</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>3 FEC100-3D (&#x000b1;T)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Total</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Number of patients</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">54</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">59</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">111</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">224</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Patients with toxicity</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">11</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">18</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">22</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">51</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Hospitalisation<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Changes in treatment plan<sup>b</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">6</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Cycle delay &#x02a7e;7 days</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">16</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">21</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">46</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Dose reduction &#x02a7e;15&#x00025;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">G-CSF</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">8</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t3-fn1"><label/><p>D=docetaxel 100&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup> every 21 days; FEC100=fluorouracil 500&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>, epirubicin 100&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup>, cyclophosphamide 500&#x02009;mg&#x02009;m<sup>&#x02212;2</sup> every 21 days; G-CSF=granulocyte colony-stimulating factor; T=trastuzumab.</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn2"><label>a</label><p>Febrile neutropaenia (<italic>n</italic>=3), cutaneous toxicity (<italic>n</italic>=1), and acute colitis (<italic>n</italic>=1).</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn3"><label>b</label><p>Suppression of one cycle of FEC because of pancytopaenia (<italic>n</italic>=1), suppression of one or two cycles of D because of hypersensitivity (<italic>n</italic>=1) or patient willingness (<italic>n</italic>=2), replacement of one cycle of FEC by D because of severe emesis (<italic>n</italic>=1), replacement of one or two cycles of D by FEC because of cutaneous toxicity (<italic>n</italic>=3).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>